WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.730
A sudden bang in a dark street.

2
00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:05.490
Within a moment, your heart is racing.

3
00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:07.160
Your pupils widen.

4
00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:10.030
Your whole body is getting ready to act.

5
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:14.180
Your heart and your eyes changed
before you had decided anything.

6
00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:16.110
So who gave the order?

7
00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:20.270
In this mission, you'll trace the signals
that switch your body into fight or

8
00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.340
flight.

9
00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:24.160
Then you'll find out how your
heart rate gets turned up,

10
00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:26.290
without you ever choosing.

11
00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:30.770
Your mission: find out who gives the order
when your heart races and your pupils

12
00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:33.570
widen before you have decided anything.
